<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Brizna "Panel" tablet widget (2026-11-07): Hoy with its client list on the left; the week and Por cobrar on the
     right. Colours are set in PanelWidget.kt (same palette as the "Hoy" widget). Unlike the Hoy layout, list rows
     ellipsize at one line: a panel lists the day, it does not replace the app. -->
